# The typer's conformance harness (tools/TyperConformance.hx): the typing layers asked what the compiler answered —
# the upstream display and misc suites of a pinned Haxe 4.3.7 clone, read from the clone, and a project's compiler
# facts. Build from the repo root; the artifact is gitignored.
#
#   haxe tools/typer-conformance.hxml
#   node bin/typer-conformance.js upstream <haxe-4.3.7-clone> [--list]
#   (cd <project> && node <anyparse>/bin/typer-conformance.js facts [<configuration>] [--list])
-cp src
-cp tools
-main TyperConformance
-lib hxnodejs
-D js-es=6
-D analyzer-optimize
-js bin/typer-conformance.js
